// extend). Same I-type shape as encode_ld but a word load: L2C MMIO registers
// must be accessed less than 8 bytes at a time (DS220 11.8.3), so the L2C
// config read-back loads a word. lwu (not lw) so a 32-bit register value does
// not sign-extend into the upper bits of the 64-bit GPR it lands in.
